WEBVTT

00:00:00.910 --> 00:00:07.480
Huh?

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:08.550
Manaka?

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:10.030
Head Disciplinarian Minami?

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:15.780
I never thought Mireille could be the Head Disciplinarian.

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.230
Manaka...

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:19.990
You were Lala all along.

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:24.230
But you sure do look different.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:29.710
Yeah, well, you know how every girl gets to shine in PriPara and all that.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:32.920
Guess so.

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:36.980
And I suppose you caught me breaking the rules again.

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:38.890
Going to PriPara...

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:39.850
Huh?

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:41.310
Huh?

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:43.960
That isn't an official school rule.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:48.520
There's no actual rule stating that
elementary schoolers can't go to PriPara.

00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:51.990
Wh-What!?

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:33.420
I always figured you probably hated idols and stuff.

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:35.560
Here you are.

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:38.380
Your Special Sparkly Shiny Prism Stone Drinks.

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:41.090
Far from it.

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:45.860
Becoming an idol is a really important dream for me.

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:49.110
And I don't want to be careless about it, either.

00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:52.370
That character I put on is
an important part of my calculations.

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:53.000
Calculations?

00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:54.440
Indeed.

00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:58.270
A complete 180° from myself as the ever-serious Head Disciplinarian.

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:01.950
Different fashion, hair, and eye color!

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:05.600
Wow! Like a totally different person!

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:07.830
Mireille's in top form once again-pri!

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:11.820
That's the idea behind Mireille the idol.

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:14.670
But to tell you the truth...

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:17.250
I was kind of hoping someone would notice it's me.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:19.550
Or not, it's still too soon!

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:24.100
But I'm tired of waiting for someone to notice, too!

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:26.010
Oh, ahem.

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:27.720
Pardon me.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:30.720
I sometimes have difficulty keeping the character from popping out.

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:34.770
Well, I'll make the big reveal when I'm ready.

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:37.190
That's amazing!

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:39.570
Amazing? But of course!

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:42.720
To reach beyond the rank of Top Idol,

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:44.660
to become a Divine Idol!

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:46.370
Divine Idol!

00:03:47.550 --> 00:03:49.040
How about you?

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:54.020
Well... is PriPara seriously not against the rules?

00:03:54.020 --> 00:03:54.880
It's not.

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:58.630
That's just something the Headmistress decided after she was put in charge.

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.660
So you haven't really done anything too bad here.

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:05.120
So that's how it was...

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:09.710
So if you become an idol big enough that the Headmistress can't stamp you out,

00:04:09.710 --> 00:04:11.500
there's no problem!

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:23.510
You must do it for the sake of those friends whose tickets were confiscated and all your supporters.

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:27.530
For Nao... For everyone!

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:30.540
And if need be, I'll protect you until then!

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:34.720
Understood! I'll do my best!

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:37.000
If it's war you want, Headmistress...

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:41.240
Manaka Lala will aim for the rank of Divine Idol!

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:43.420
Just what I wanted to hear.

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:46.440
Our special training regimen starts tomorrow.

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:46.990
What?

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:50.210
Welcome to Prism Stone!

00:04:50.210 --> 00:04:52.270
Please insert your My Ticket.

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:00.380
PriPara Change Complete!

00:05:16.280 --> 00:05:18.500
Popping Gala Complete!

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:26.970
Well, we just got changed, but now it's time to change into practice wear-pri!

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:32.470
Alright! Time to begin our idol basics training-pri!

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:33.050
Right, get cracking! No slacking-kuma!

00:05:33.050 --> 00:05:34.700
It's an honor.

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:36.310
Right, get cracking! No slacking-kuma!

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:41.570
This team's gonna be a huge hit! Bottoms up!

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:43.070
Man, that hit the spot!

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:45.740
Basic Idol Skill Number 1:

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:46.240
Smiling!

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:50.350
According to an analysis of 100,000 different smiles,

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:54.220
the optimal neck angle is 37.3° to the right.

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:57.250
Then arc your mouth precisely 30.1°...

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:58.870
And smile!

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:02.630
Wow! That's so cute!

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:04.450
Your turn, Lala-pri!

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:05.130
Okay!

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:10.840
I just remembered a funny thing from a comic I read! I can't stop laughing!

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:14.390
All wrong!

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:16.450
You call that being an idol?

00:06:17.030 --> 00:06:18.900
Number 2: Walking!

00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:23.880
Make it seem as if an angel is pulling you along from the heavens-pri.

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:27.190
Here we go...

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:30.970
Angel, please!

00:06:30.970 --> 00:06:32.480
Totally botched-pri!

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:33.810
Are you even trying?

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:36.910
Number 3: Handshake!

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:41.660
This handshake android will teach you to make snap judgments

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:44.880
for perfect handshakes at any conceivable angle-pri!

00:06:45.190 --> 00:06:46.000
Pri!

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:51.630
Thank you so much-pri! Thank you-pri! Thank you-pri! Thank you-pri...

00:06:51.630 --> 00:06:53.200
Give it a whirl, Lala-pri!

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:53.550
Okay!

00:06:58.090 --> 00:06:59.810
Thank you for your support...

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:06.150
Why'd I get caught in that?

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:08.070
Number 4: Autograph!

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:12.710
Everything about that sucks!

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:14.240
Are you even trying-pri?

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:23.630
I'll have to work harder so Mireille won't get mad at me...

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:25.460
Autograph, autograph...

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:27.090
I can smell them!

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:30.800
<i>It's not an official rule so don't worry about it. Don't worry...</i>

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:34.160
Such a stench!

00:07:36.990 --> 00:07:38.220
She's scary anyway!

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:40.770
Stop your pointless struggling!

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:44.590
I... I don't have any PriTickets!

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:44.980
Hold up!

00:07:45.430 --> 00:07:48.440
I'm so glad I actually left them at home today!

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:50.280
You're not getting away!

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:00.700
Uh, that's just...

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:02.540
Hmm? It smells just like PriTickets!

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:05.720
<i>She'll realize I'm an idol if she sees inside it!</i>

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:09.460
Bahh, bahhh~

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:13.280
I was... I was just practicing my goat impersonation!

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:15.680
Paper sure is tasty!

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:17.470
Goat, you say?

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:18.970
<i>I shouldn't have expected that to work...</i>

00:08:19.280 --> 00:08:21.460
<i>This</i> is how you impersonate a goat!

00:08:21.460 --> 00:08:25.230
Bahh! Baahh! Baaaaaahhhh!

00:08:25.780 --> 00:08:29.240
Now, try again...

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:30.730
Huh!?

00:08:36.020 --> 00:08:37.580
Somehow I made it!

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:42.020
No running up the stairs!

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:44.000
This is your 100th recorded transgression!

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:49.260
Paprika Academy rule number 9128:

00:08:49.260 --> 00:08:51.710
Students who are issued 100 warnings

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:57.390
must polish the statue of our school's founder until they can see their reflection in it.

00:09:01.980 --> 00:09:03.810
No no no!

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:06.040
Failing at basics like this!

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:10.000
Your idol rank is way <i>way</i> below Student!

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:11.280
You're barely worth the scraps of a Student's eraser-pri!

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:17.030
And here I thought you had some talent.

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:18.990
Mireille's finally made a miscalculation-pri!

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:22.660
Uh-huh! Talk about a letdown-kuma. Glug-glug!

00:09:23.190 --> 00:09:24.230
Sorry!

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:28.800
I've been running from the Headmistress so often I can't concentrate!

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:29.600
No excuses!

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:33.590
You really think you can come up with a Making Drama like that?

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:35.790
Making Drama?

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:38.590
Oh, is that that thing we did

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:40.810
during our performance?

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:47.880
Yes. It's an element every bit as important as your singing, dancing, and outfit coordination.

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:50.400
It's a true test of an idol's expression-pri!

00:09:51.210 --> 00:09:52.610
Expression?

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:56.990
What do you think and feel in your ordinary life?

00:09:56.990 --> 00:10:00.290
What do you want to express through song?

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:02.330
It means to convey something meaningful to others-pri!

00:10:03.230 --> 00:10:07.040
What you think and feel? What you want to express?

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:08.040
That said,

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:12.040
you're in charge of the Making Drama for tomorrow's performance!

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:14.510
What?!

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:25.980
Welcome!

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:31.440
PriPara TV Dream Hour will now play the most requested song of the past week!

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:36.360
<i>I have no idea what to do about the Making Drama.</i>

00:10:36.810 --> 00:10:38.880
Hey, Sis! Look, look!

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:40.360
Sophie's coming on!

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:45.080
Presenting the genius said to have been born to be an idol:

00:10:45.650 --> 00:10:50.370
Houjou Sophie singing "Solar Flare Sherbet"!

00:11:30.390 --> 00:11:32.800
Cyalume Change!

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:47.760
So cool! I'll never get tired of her!

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:49.340
She's great, isn't she?

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:49.730
Yeah.

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:54.180
<i>Sophie... I want to be like that too.</i>

00:11:56.760 --> 00:12:00.050
<i>I don't want to let Mireille down!</i>

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:01.070
Hey, Lala!

00:12:01.520 --> 00:12:03.790
Could you deliver a pizza?

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:04.950
Capisce!

00:12:07.770 --> 00:12:11.210
It's going to Pride Tower Hills on the Parajuku 5th street.

00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:13.590
The building manager's office is right at the entrance, you can leave it there.

00:12:13.590 --> 00:12:17.880
The lovely delicious pizza is donestrone!

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:21.170
Huh? Are those... pickled plums?

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:23.340
Is that even on our menu?

00:12:23.610 --> 00:12:24.990
Quite mysterious, isn't it?

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:29.310
This customer always gets this special Pickled Plum Pizza.

00:12:29.840 --> 00:12:32.770
And even I've never met them.

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:39.680
Whoa, this seems crazy luxurious.

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:45.110
Don't mind me...

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:47.640
Wow...

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.540
Wow! Fishies!

00:12:52.530 --> 00:12:56.110
Hello! I'm delivering fish! Uh, wait...

00:12:56.110 --> 00:12:57.500
I'm delivering a pizza!

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:00.970
Ah yes, from Papa's Pasta?

00:13:00.970 --> 00:13:03.090
Just a moment please.

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:03.470
Hm?

00:13:11.530 --> 00:13:17.100
That... That's the Red Flash...

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:21.320
Huh? Did you order the Pickled Plum Pizza?

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:23.750
Yes... Yes...

00:13:24.270 --> 00:13:27.780
I... I see. You came to pick it up directly.

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:30.530
Here you go!

00:13:32.230 --> 00:13:34.500
Red Flash!

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:38.780
I see! Red Flash means the pickled plums.

00:13:38.780 --> 00:13:40.710
Fanksalot...

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:46.590
Well, she was a bit unusual,

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:49.230
But I'm glad she seemed so happy with it!

00:13:50.780 --> 00:13:54.600
But now I gotta get home and make that Making Drama!

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:58.810
Huh? It's still not done-kuma?

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:02.220
I spent all yesterday racking my brain,

00:14:02.220 --> 00:14:04.280
but I just can't come up with anything.

00:14:04.630 --> 00:14:07.760
Oh man! The concert is today-kuma!

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:09.540
I've been keeping quiet about it,

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:12.740
but it's not actually just my neck that's on the line here-kuma!

00:14:13.150 --> 00:14:13.700
What?

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:15.490
I've got...

00:14:15.490 --> 00:14:20.170
I've got all these kids to feed-kuma!

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:22.130
What the heck?

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:25.640
Oh, what's that? You're hungry?

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:30.470
Sorry, but I can't afford any milk because that girl there is such a useless slob.

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:32.880
There, there...

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:35.680
Oh! Are you okay?

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:36.430
Are you okay?

00:14:39.760 --> 00:14:42.190
And what might you be doing over there?

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:45.860
Hold it!

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:46.540
No way!

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:47.330
I said hold it!

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:48.530
Somebody save me!

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:08.380
Headmistress... There's something important I wish to speak about.

00:15:12.420 --> 00:15:15.760
What is this important thing you wanted to tell me?

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:18.880
You've always been an exemplary head disciplinarian.

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:20.230
Feel free to speak openly.

00:15:21.910 --> 00:15:23.190
Please take a look at this.

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:31.110
According to my analysis, 99.9% of elementary school age girls are interested in PriPara.

00:15:31.690 --> 00:15:38.810
In fact, 97.9% of those who have gone to PriPara have shown an increase in their grades.

00:15:38.810 --> 00:15:45.860
And instances of forgetting homework or skipping housework are seen among a mere 1.8% of PriPara-goers.

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:46.210
Furthermore—

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:47.680
Head Disciplinarian,

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:50.060
what are you hoping to accomplish here?

00:15:50.060 --> 00:15:53.800
No amount of explaining will change the ban on PriPara for our elementary schoolers.

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:59.980
But I must insist PriPara is not at all the terrible place you imagine it to be!

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:07.350
As seen here, 85.7% of PriPara-goers have made new friends there!

00:16:07.350 --> 00:16:09.650
And this figure should be assumed to be rising as we speak.

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:13.910
Friends?

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:16.940
Making friends is a wonderful thing!

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:20.910
Of course, increasing one's Idol Rank remains a trying ordeal all the same.

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:23.680
Practice doesn't always go as planned,

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:26.670
and sometimes that can create strain in a relationship,

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:28.880
which can lead to a degree of discomfort.

00:16:31.980 --> 00:16:35.050
But that is all a result of placing genuine trust in one's friends!

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:40.430
I believe continuing to perform will ultimately only deepen friendships!

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:41.480
Silence!

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:48.900
Never use the word <i>friend</i> in my presence again!

00:16:49.220 --> 00:16:49.920
But...

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:53.070
Nothing will make me change my stance on the matter of elementary schoolers and PriPara!

00:16:59.300 --> 00:17:03.160
I understand... I will excuse myself for today.

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:09.610
Friends? Ridiculous.

00:17:10.430 --> 00:17:16.090
Come to think of it, I think I've seen those two together an awful lot as of late.

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:20.510
Manaka Lala... You just get more and more suspicious.

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:28.020
The Head Disciplinarian thought of me like that all along...

00:17:28.740 --> 00:17:33.060
I want to express my gratitude! I want to deliver it!

00:17:33.060 --> 00:17:35.400
Just like I delivered that pizza!

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:39.870
One order of my thoughts and feelings.

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:50.500
Capisce!

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:53.960
Argh! We're in big trouble-kuma!

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:56.480
Lala doesn't have our Making Drama ready!

00:17:56.480 --> 00:18:00.430
This Lemon Drop Audition Live is gonna be rough-kuma! Rough, I say!

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:04.000
Our chance of success is...

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:06.410
0.1% pri!

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:09.350
Sorry for the wait.

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:12.820
Lala, do you have the Making Drama?

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:15.530
Mireille! Let's do our best out there!

00:18:19.920 --> 00:18:21.990
Your Friend Ticket entry succeeded.

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:25.580
Scan the tickets needed for your coord.

00:18:31.780 --> 00:18:33.210
Coord Change Start!

00:18:36.730 --> 00:18:39.010
The Flower Meringue Coord.

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:42.970
Like a fairy lured out by flowers in bloom!

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:44.620
Flower Meringue!

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:51.240
The combination of fluffy styles is lovely!

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:54.320
This gets my thumbs up!

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:56.740
Flower Meringue-pri!

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:21.300
<i>Wow! I can feel that we're much more in sync than usual!</i>

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:24.350
<i>I really feel like I can communicate with Lala-pri!</i>

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:40.300
Making Drama! Switch on!

00:19:44.550 --> 00:19:45.830
Twirly twirl!

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:48.160
What's in it?

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:56.290
Present For You!

00:19:59.310 --> 00:20:02.110
Cyalume Change!

00:20:23.130 --> 00:20:25.670
Yahoo! We passed-kuma!

00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:29.440
Lala's Making Drama gave us the turnaround we needed!

00:20:29.440 --> 00:20:32.000
Not that my producer skills aren't to thank as well.

00:20:36.220 --> 00:20:39.320
Lala! Nice work-pri!

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:42.240
Oh, that's right, you dropped this-pri.

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:43.930
Thank you so much, Mireille!

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:46.690
I saw it, you know.

00:20:46.690 --> 00:20:51.600
I saw you trying to make the
headmistress repeal the ban on PriPara.

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:54.890
That... That was, uh...

00:20:54.890 --> 00:20:58.110
Totally calculated! Yep, all calculated, of course-pri!

00:20:58.520 --> 00:21:02.720
I was fully aware that you were peeking into the office-pri!

00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:04.280
Really, I was-pri!

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:05.410
Seriously!

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:06.070
Mireille!

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:14.830
I really do think I can become even better friends with you, Mireille!

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:16.670
So relax more, I don't bite-pri!

00:21:17.190 --> 00:21:23.090
Oh! Let's, uh, keep trying to get along, Mireille!

00:21:23.770 --> 00:21:25.550
We'll do great together-pri!

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:29.100
So, how'd you come up with that Making Drama anyway?

00:21:29.610 --> 00:21:31.060
Well, it was...

00:23:05.820 --> 00:23:08.860
This is my first fan, Eiko!

00:23:08.860 --> 00:23:11.950
I'll be cheering for her tennis match by singing at PriPara!

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:14.440
I can smell them!

00:23:14.440 --> 00:23:15.620
Headmistress?

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:18.590
Manaka Lala! You're planning on going to PriPara, are you not?

00:23:18.590 --> 00:23:20.080
Of... Of course not!

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:21.350
Quite suspicious!

00:23:21.350 --> 00:23:25.630
I must come observe the situation at your home!

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:28.090
What? How do I deal with this?

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:31.500
Next time: Capisce! Cheer For You

00:23:32.090 --> 00:23:34.890
Go for it! Let's go! PriPara!
